---
source: flick/tests/help_command.rs
expression: "stdout(&[\"help\", \"build\"])"
---
Compile the project, or the given files, to ES modules

Usage: flick build [OPTIONS] [PATHS]...

Arguments:
  [PATHS]...  Files or directories to compile, with everything they import; by default the project's source root

Options:
      --diagnostics <DIAGNOSTICS>  Format of diagnostics on stderr [default: human] [possible values: human, json]
      --out-dir <DIR>              Directory of the output; by default `build.out-dir` of the project
      --color <COLOR>              Colorize human-readable output [default: auto] [possible values: auto, always, never]
      --emit <EMIT>                Emit JavaScript or TypeScript; by default `build.emit` of the project [possible values: js, ts]
      --quiet                      Print less service output
      --verbose                    Print more service output
      --project <PATH>             Project directory or its `flick.toml`; by default the nearest `flick.toml` from the working directory upwards
  -h, --help                       Print help
